WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:04.230
Here's how to take an appointment from
recording to client follow-up in noctune.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.640
Choose New Encounter
and select your patient.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.590
noctune includes general
SOAP and discharge templates.

00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:13.565
You can explore community
templates or create your own.

00:00:13.655 --> 00:00:16.205
For this visit, we'll use
the general templates.

00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:21.057
Record the appointment in your browser,
or upload an existing audio file.

00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:24.257
Review the queued recording,
then submit it for processing.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.230
noctune transcribes the recording
and prepares draft notes.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.920
You can leave this screen and return from

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.750
the Encounters queue
when the draft is ready.

00:00:32.507 --> 00:00:35.617
Review the clinical note against
the transcript and audio.

00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:37.947
Click a highlighted
citation or annotation to

00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:40.177
jump to the matching audio and transcript.

00:00:40.347 --> 00:00:42.977
Check the patient details,
findings, and plan.

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:45.777
The draft is a starting point
for your clinical review.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.550
Choose Edit to make
corrections, then Save.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:52.510
When your review is
finished, choose Complete.

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:56.190
Saving an edit and completing
the encounter are separate steps.

00:00:56.827 --> 00:00:59.387
Review your discharge
instructions, then choose

00:00:59.387 --> 00:01:02.017
Send Email and Send discharge notes.

00:01:02.412 --> 00:01:04.242
Every account can send them.

00:01:04.252 --> 00:01:08.242
Without Nest, discharge emails
use no reply by default.

00:01:08.332 --> 00:01:12.562
Confirm the recipient before sending;
drafts are never sent automatically.

00:01:13.293 --> 00:01:17.523
With noctune Nest, clients can reply
through a private relay address.

00:01:17.773 --> 00:01:20.493
Your personal email stays
hidden, and client replies

00:01:20.493 --> 00:01:23.123
come back to noctune,
linked to the encounter.

00:01:23.213 --> 00:01:25.923
Open Messages to follow up
with the visit in context.
